# Fredrin worktree tooling. Only the machine-local, credential-bearing parts are
# ignored — NOT the whole .fredrin/ directory: FREDRIN.md is meant to be
# committed, and .fredrin/memory/ is this project's Memory bundle, which
# `fredrin ticket context` can only read once it is git-tracked.
.fredrin/fredrin
.fredrin/fredrin.cmd
.fredrin/context-pack.mjs
.fredrin/hooks/
.vercel
.env*
